From 08ef6f6b35de604d2231db07094110cc04adb1a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hyunW3 <0176778602@naver.com>
Date: Sun, 24 May 2026 12:21:17 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 08/22] config: disable mid-training eval trigger (eval.every:
 9999999)

lingua's train loop tries to submit an async eval SLURM job when
checkpoint.eval.every fires; with async_eval_gpus=0 (single 4-GPU
node, no SLURM) it asserts and aborts:

  File 'apps/aunet/train.py', line 609
    assert args.async_eval_gpus > 0
  AssertionError

Crash hit at step 50000 (1d 19h in) on the first eval trigger.
Set eval.every well past the 180k total so it never fires; we'll
run a single final lm-eval after training completes (Step 5).

Resume is seamless: lingua picks up from checkpoints/0000050000.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 apps/aunet/configs/aunet2_1.3B_b200.yaml | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/apps/aunet/configs/aunet2_1.3B_b200.yaml b/apps/aunet/configs/aunet2_1.3B_b200.yaml
index b3e37f9..1212ca3 100644
--- a/apps/aunet/configs/aunet2_1.3B_b200.yaml
+++ b/apps/aunet/configs/aunet2_1.3B_b200.yaml
@@ -75,7 +75,10 @@ checkpoint:
         every: 2000
         keep: 1
     eval:
-        every: 50000
+        # Disable mid-training eval triggers. lingua tries to submit an async eval
+        # job at this cadence; with async_eval_gpus=0 (single 4-GPU node) it asserts.
+        # We'll do a single final eval (Step 5) after training completes.
+        every: 9999999
         keep: 1
 
 logging:
